		{"id":"dba15b49d646e61a","type":"text","text":"# End \nToday I introduced my belongings to you. There must be lots of mistakes in the video. Please point them out for me, I'll be greatful to you.\nThat's all, see you next video.","x":-422,"y":-140,"width":454,"height":100},
		{"id":"694d6f6495b1cf5c","type":"text","text":"# Text\nIn front of me, it is a wooden table. It's small and old,  and My stuff barely fits. There is also a drawer under the table, but It **can't hold** much.\n Look here. I have a few books, Two textbooks, a grammar book and an English story. This book whose name is Family Album USA. Recently, I'm learning it. You can see it;  I wrote a lot of notes on it. here is also the book who I bought a few years. its name is The Little Prince. Up to now I have just started to read it.\n  I have two charging cables, one is my phone's, the other is my tablet's. Speaking of my tablet, it's an OPPO Pad 4. Its screen is very clear, I mostly use it for learning and watching moives. This is my tablet keyborad. it's useful. \nBehind me, there is a wardrobe. It's filled with all my clothes.\nAs you can see, that's all my belongings.\nI live alone, so I have no much my belongings, and just there are some necessities and learning materials.","x":160,"y":-629,"width":640,"height":540},
		{"id":"12fe5fab754004e8","type":"text","text":"# Start\nHi, guys! Today, In the episode, I want to show you about my belongings. This room is not my home, so my stuff is few.","x":-1040,"y":-444,"width":540,"height":163}
